From 99b48cbeff9b4e2af196de5c04e869762d345dc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rdr-port <rdr-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:11:51 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 46/47] Texture pack: file kept open, art read by a loader
 thread (guest texture until ready), preload of the last run's entries, memory
 budget, read stats every 5 s

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/d3d/nv2a_pb_d3d11.c    |  24 ++-
 src/kernel/nv2a_tex_pack.c | 404 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/kernel/nv2a_tex_pack.h |  12 ++
 3 files changed, 415 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

